sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Auth Server
    participant R as Resource API
    U->>C: Click "Log in"
    C->>A: GET /authorize
    A-->>U: Login page
    U->>A: Submit credentials
    A-->>C: Authorization code
    C->>A: POST /token (code)
    A-->>C: Access token
    C->>R: GET /data (token)
    R-->>C: 200 OK + data
    C-->>U: Render dashboard
